            </classificationInformation>
            <common:generalComment xml:lang="en">Vermiculite transportet by ship 13'500 km from South-Africa to Germany. It is expanded by the heat from light fuel oil in 5 – 8 s at 1250 – 1500 °C and then cooled immediately to 400 °C. Density of expanded vermiculite: 64 - 160 kg/m3;
Synonyms: Blähglimmer; 
UUID: 08f36cf9-cf14-319b-bcde-01f222230559</common:generalComment>
